msgstr "En eller anden"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:2591
msgid "That log lives outside this site, so Minn will not clear it."
msgstr "Den log ligger uden for dette websted, så Minn rydder den ikke."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:2599
msgid "The debug log is not writable."
msgstr "Fejlloggen er ikke skrivbar."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:2603
