msgstr "Vælg mindst ét billede."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:2658
msgid "That block could not be rebuilt for those images."
msgstr "Den blok kunne ikke genopbygges til de billeder."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:3001
msgid "Expected an array of block markup strings."
msgstr "Forventede et array af blokmarkup-strenge."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:3468
#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:3493
msgid "That surface has no setup to run."
msgstr "Den flade har ingen opsætning at køre."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:3496
msgid "This setup runs on the plugin's own screen."
msgstr "Denne opsætning kører på pluginnets egen skærm."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:3516
msgid "The plugin reported an error during setup."
msgstr "Pluginnet rapporterede en fejl under opsætningen."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:3571
msgid "Pattern not found."
msgstr "Blokgruppe ikke fundet."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:3642
msgid "A custom structure needs at least one tag, e.g. %postname%."
msgstr "En brugerdefineret struktur skal have mindst ét tag, f.eks. %postname%."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:3713
msgid "The custom CSS was changed somewhere else after you opened it. Copy your edit, reload, and apply it again."
msgstr "Den brugerdefinerede CSS blev ændret et andet sted, efter du åbnede den. Kopier din redigering, genindlæs, og anvend den igen."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:3730
msgid "curly brackets"
msgstr "krøllede parenteser"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:3731
msgid "parentheses"
msgstr "parenteser"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:3732
msgid "square brackets"
msgstr "firkantede parenteser"

#. translators: %s: the bracket type that is unbalanced (e.g. "curly brackets").
#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:3737
msgid "That CSS has unbalanced %s. Fix it and save again; nothing was changed."
msgstr "Den CSS har ubalancerede %s. Ret det og gem igen; intet blev ændret."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:3741
msgid "That CSS has an unclosed comment. Fix it and save again; nothing was changed."
msgstr "Den CSS har en uafsluttet kommentar. Ret det og gem igen; intet blev ændret."

#. translators: 1: the window's first day (e.g. "Jun 3"). 2: its last day with the year (e.g. "Jul 2, 2026").
